## 支柱1：企业级组件注册系统

### 📍 位置与作用

```yaml
位置: src/SmartAbp.Vue/packages/lowcode-shared/src/components/ComponentRegistry.ts
作用: 统一管理所有低代码组件的注册、加载、卸载和生命周期
```

### 🎯 核心功能

```typescript
// 1. 组件注册
import { registerComponent, ComponentMetadata } from '@smartabp/lowcode-shared'

registerComponent({
  name: 'SmartFormBuilder',
  displayName: '智能表单构建器',
  category: 'form',
  priority: 'high',
  dependencies: ['BaseComponent'],
  bundle: '@smartabp/lowcode-core',
  lazy: true,
  preload: false,
  version: '1.0.0',
  tags: ['form', 'builder']
})

// 2. 组件加载
import { loadComponent } from '@smartabp/lowcode-shared'

const FormBuilder = await loadComponent('SmartFormBuilder')

// 3. 组件查找
import { getComponentMetadata, globalComponentRegistry } from '@smartabp/lowcode-shared'

const metadata = getComponentMetadata('SmartFormBuilder')
const formComponents = globalComponentRegistry.getCategoryComponents('form')
```

### ✅ AI编程时必须遵循

```yaml
创建新组件时:
  1. ✅ 必须在ComponentRegistry中注册
  2. ✅ 必须提供完整的ComponentMetadata
  3. ✅ 必须声明依赖关系
  4. ✅ 必须指定正确的category
  5. ✅ 必须设置合理的加载优先级

禁止行为:
  ❌ 不注册直接使用组件
  ❌ 硬编码组件路径
  ❌ 跳过依赖声明
  ❌ 创建重复名称的组件
```

### 📝 标准组件创建流程

```typescript
// 步骤1: 创建组件文件
// src/SmartAbp.Vue/packages/lowcode-core/src/components/SmartDatePicker.vue

<script setup lang="ts">
import { BaseComponent } from '@smartabp/lowcode-shared'

interface Props {
  modelValue: string
  format?: string
}

const props = withDefaults(defineProps<Props>(), {
  format: 'YYYY-MM-DD'
})

const emit = defineEmits<{
  'update:modelValue': [value: string]
}>()
</script>

// 步骤2: 导出组件
// src/SmartAbp.Vue/packages/lowcode-core/src/components/index.ts

export { default as SmartDatePicker } from './SmartDatePicker.vue'

// 步骤3: 注册组件
// src/SmartAbp.Vue/packages/lowcode-core/src/index.ts

import { registerComponent } from '@smartabp/lowcode-shared'
import { SmartDatePicker } from './components'

export function registerCoreComponents() {
  registerComponent({
    name: 'SmartDatePicker',
    displayName: '智能日期选择器',
    category: 'form',
    priority: 'medium',
    dependencies: ['BaseComponent'],
    bundle: '@smartabp/lowcode-core',
    lazy: false,
    preload: true,
    version: '1.0.0',
    tags: ['form', 'date', 'picker']
  })
}
```

